        {
          "anchor" : "overview",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Overview",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Value sample typically taken from simulation generated time series for given entity and",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "at a time currently visualised.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "For example, an application has a simulation player that replays simulation states. The player",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "has a current simulation time (playhead cursor) and the value in this component is a value from",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "time series at that time.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Used for visual value indicators, such as bars above simulation objects (blocks, pictograms).",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content" : [
